## Global Rules

Read `docs/ai/rules/global.md` for invariants that apply to all code in this repository.

<rules>
<rule>Layer order: Core Utils → Core Rules → MustClauses → GuardClauses → Integrations</rule>
<rule>Must owns canonical messages; Guard/Fluent/Data reuse them (never duplicate)</rule>
<rule>Guard calls Must (never duplicate logic)</rule>
<rule>Deterministic: No IO in Core Rules/Utils</rule>
<rule>File-scoped namespaces, sorted usings, arrow functions for single-line expressions</rule>
<rule>All output files → artifacts/ or logs/, NEVER project root</rule>
</rules>

